&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Trosol&lt;/color&gt; has nobody to spare to rescue &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Cass&lt;/color&gt;, but says that if you can make it to &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Cass&lt;/color&gt;'s position and rescue her, she will join you.

