					<description>A desperate refugee named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Steroid&lt;/color&gt; is approaching. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Steroid&lt;/color&gt; claims to have lost his home in a recent attack. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Steroid&lt;/color&gt; begs you for permission to stay at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt; for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;7 days&lt;/color&gt; so he can rest and regroup.

