					<description>Duke &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Calber Eurlisnus&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt; is requesting that you build a monument to spread images of his glory across the land.

The monument is 5 x 10 in size and will require these resources (total value $276):

  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x215
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x92
    - Granite blocks x92
    - Limestone blocks x92
    - Slate blocks x92
    - Marble blocks x92

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;10 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task.

After completion, you'll have to protect the monument for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;21 days&lt;/color&gt;. If any piece of it is destroyed, the duke's enforcement system will activate and a weather-control system will force the weather around &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt; to be a fog for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;14 days&lt;/color&gt;.

You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.</description>
