								<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
								<text>You've finally learned the location of the relic Axe of Promises!

The relic is housed in an ancient structure. It is protected by a security system with multiple independent units. You may choose to defeat the security forces one unit at a time before taking the relic, or try to grab it and flee before they can harm you.

After 3 days, all security systems will be alerted.</text>
