					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt;, Ethical Chair of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Erera&lt;/color&gt;, has discovered an ancient complex a long distance away. She believes it contains information about the relic known as &lt;color=#D9D9BFFF&gt;Axe of Promises&lt;/color&gt;.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt; can't spare people to look into it, but hopes you can help by supplying exactly 5 colonists to carry out the investigation.

The complex contains unknown threats and is also being sought by &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt;'s enemies, &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Burning Unit&lt;/color&gt;.

She will send a shuttle to pick up your colonists, bring them to the complex, and take them home afterward. They will be fed and tended to en-route.

Once you have landed, you must hack all terminals in the complex within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;2.8 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
