					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Freda 'Bunny' Yee&lt;/color&gt;, Ethical Chair of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Erera&lt;/color&gt;, has sent us a message. Apparently, outlanders based in a nearby camp have been raiding their caravans. The camp is controlled by &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Neroda Alliance&lt;/color&gt;.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt; is asking us to destroy the camp, which means eliminating all enemies and turrets. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt; says that there's a bandit camp at the site guarded by (*Threat)6 outlanders(/Threat).</description>
					<root>OpportunitySite_BanditCamp</root>
