					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gray Squirrel&lt;/color&gt;, Root Chief of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Cagalbra Pact&lt;/color&gt;, has sent us a message. He wants to talk with us in a nearby location.

It could be a great opportunity to improve relations with their faction and receive gifts, but beware - a poor negotiator can cause more harm than good and may even anger them.

Other factions will respect you more if you send your leader to handle the negotiations. High Stellarch &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Robert Krondorfer&lt;/color&gt; will get a bonus to the chance of a successful outcome.</description>
