						<li Class="QuestPart_Letter">
							<inSignal>Quest89.BossgroupArrives</inSignal>
							<letter Class="StandardLetter">
								<ID>623</ID>
								<def>Bossgroup</def>
								<label>Diabolus arrived</label>
								<lookTargets>
									<targets>
										<li>null</li>
										<li>null</li>
										<li>null</li>
										<li>null</li>
									</targets>
								</lookTargets>
								<relatedFaction>Faction_12</relatedFaction>
								<text>An ultra-heavy mech from (*Faction=Faction_12)Nyaralph Mechhive(/Faction) has come to eradicate you, along with escorts.

The diabolus is equipped with a concrete-melting hellsphere cannon. It is slow to charge, but when it fires it will annihilate anything in the blast circle.

The assault group is composed of the following mechanoids:

  - Diabolus x1
