						<description>"I looked at this mega-corp CEO, with his pitiful rent-a-cops, all that power left fallow. I tried to convince him that you never really come together with someone until you eat them. If anyone disagrees, I'm always ready to defend myself."

  - &lt;i&gt;Murder&lt;/i&gt; by Alexander 'Alex' Moe</description>
