						<description>"In my daily visitations with the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;squirrel&lt;/color&gt;s I learned to truly listen to them. Over and over, in their own way, they repeated their message to me: What you can't defend doesn't belong to you. If anyone disagrees, I'm always ready to defend myself."

